        'спутниковое ТВ КНР ABS-S (по названию патента — «video broadcasting applications»)', [S(US, r'codeword length N=15360'), S(US, r'without any aid of concatenated codes'), S(US, r'symbol scrambler 908 scrambles'), S(US, r'matrix of size 32x32'), S(US, r'13/15, and 9/10'), S(CN, r'附表A.{1,3}速率.{1,2}1/4')],
